OL,3,GNEWSA'Invest NI made mistakes but I
OL,4,Awant to restore trust' - senior
OL,5,Aofficial
OL,6,
OL,7,FA senior figure at Invest NI in the
OL,8,Fnorth west has said she wants to
OL,9,Frestore trust in the organisation as
OL,10,Fpart of her new role but would not have
OL,11,Ftaken the job if she did not believe it
OL,12,Fwas truly committed to regional
OL,13,Fbalance.
OL,15,FAeidin McCarter, who was announced as
OL,16,FInvest NI's head of regional business
OL,17,Ffor the north west in May, said
OL,18,F"mistakes have been made" in the past
OL,19,Fbut regional balance is now "front and
OL,20,Fcentre" for the organisation.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
